:1.8em;margin-top:10px;margin-bottom:10px;"><span style="font-family:&quot;思源黑体 CN Regular&quot;;font-size:19px;"><span style="font-family:Calibri;color:#000000;font-size:15px;">B</span><span style="color:#000000;font-size:15px;">、悬挂缩进</span></span></p><p style="line-height:1.8em;margin-top:10px;margin-bottom:10px;"><span style="font-family:&quot;思源黑体 CN Regular&quot;;font-size:19px;"><span style="font-family:Calibri;color:#000000;font-size:15px;">C</span><span style="color:#000000;font-size:15px;">、左缩进</span></span></p><p style="line-height:1.8em;margin-top:10px;margin-bottom:10px;"><span style="font-family:&quot;思源黑体 CN Regular&quot;;font-size:19px;"><span style="font-family:Calibri;color:#000000;font-size:15px;">D</span><span style="color:#000000;font-size:15px;">、右缩进</span></span></p><p style="line-height:1.8em;margin-top:10px;margin-bottom:10px;"><span style="font-family:&quot;思源黑体 CN Regular&quot;;font-size:19px;"><span style="font-family:Calibri;color:#000000;font-size:15px;">28</span><span style="color:#000000;font-size:15px;">、下列选项中，与</span><span style="font-family:Calibri;color:#000000;font-size:15px;">&quot;</span><span style="color:#000000;font-size:15px;">取件一寄件</span><span style="font-family:Calibri;color:#000000;font-size:15px;">&quot;</span><span style="color:#000000;font-size:15px;">的逻辑关系相同的是</span></span><span style="font-family:&quot;思源黑体 CN Regular&quot;;font-size:19px;"><span style="color:#000000;font-size:15px;">（</span><span style="color:#000000;font-size:15px;">&nbsp; &nbsp; ）</span></span><span style="font-family:&quot;思源黑体 CN Regular&quot;;color:#000000;font-size:15px;">。</span></p><p style="line-height:1.8em;margin-top:10px;margin-bottom:10px;"><span style="font-family:&quot;思源黑体 CN Regular&quot;;font-size:19px;"><span style="font-family:Calibri;color:#000000;font-size:15px;">A</span><span style="color:#000000;font-size:15px;">、</span><span style="font-family:Calibri;color:#000000;font-size:15px;">&quot;</span><span style="color:#000000;fon