\">（<\/span><span style=\"color:#000000;font-size:15px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; ）<\/span><\/span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;思源黑体 CN Regular&quot;;color:#000000;font-size:15px;\">。<\/span><\/p><p style=\"line-height:1.8em;margin-top:10px;margin-bottom:10px;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;思源黑体 CN Regular&quot;;font-size:19px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;color:#000000;font-size:15px;\">A<\/span><span style=\"color:#000000;font-size:15px;\">、解聘<\/span><\/span><\/p><p style=\"line-height:1.8em;margin-top:10px;margin-bottom:10px;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;思源黑体 CN Regular&quot;;font-size:19px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;color:#000000;font-size:15px;\">B<\/span><span style=\"color:#000000;font-size:15px;\">、警告<\/span><\/span><\/p><p style=\"line-height:1.8em;margin-top:10px;margin-bottom:10px;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;思源黑体 CN Regular&quot;;font-size:19px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;color:#000000;font-size:15px;\">C<\/span><span style=\"color:#000000;font-size:15px;\">、罚款<\/span><\/span><\/p><p style=\"line-height:1.8em;margin-top:10px;margin-bottom:10px;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;思源黑体 CN Regular&quot;;font-size:19px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;color:#000000;font-size:15px;\">D<\/span><span style=\"color:#000000;font-size:15px;\">、训诫<\/span><\/span><\/p><p style=\"line-height:1.8em;margin-top:10px;margin-bottom:10px;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;思源黑体 CN Regular&quot;;font-size:19px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;color:#000000;font-size:15px;\">7<\/span><span style=\"color:#000000;font-size:15px;\">、梁某无不正当理由，不送女儿小芳接受义务教育，依据《中华人民共和国义务教育法》由当地乡镇人民政府或者县级人民政府教育行政部门给予梁某<\/span><\/span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;思源黑体 CN Regular&quot;;font-size:19px;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;font-size:15px;\">（<\/span><span style=\"color:#000000;font-size:15px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; ）<\/span><\/span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;思源黑体 CN Regular&quot;;color:#000000;font-size:15px;\">。<\/span><\/p><p style=\"line-height:1.8em;